   Using a helm of opposite alignment doesn't work like this. Once a monster
is created its alignment relative to your own is fixed - a friendly monster
will remain friendly. You won't be punished but your luck has been adversely
affected, don't pray until you've recovered. Preferably by sacrificing.

   As you point out, tengus are generally friendly to lawful characters.
Your only option is to keep the helm on until the game generates other
tengus.



